  "markdown_content": "## Key Features\\nThe Vivo T4x in India has arrived as promised, standing out as a budget smartphone with an emphasis on battery life\u2014ideal for power users.\\n\\n## Battery and Display\\n* Massive 6,500mAh battery capacity\\n* One of the largest battery offerings in its segment\\n* 120Hz refresh rate display\\n* Smooth scrolling experience\\n* Enhanced visual performance\\n\\n## Performance\\nThe Vivo T4x comes equipped with modern hardware that handles:\\n* Daily tasks efficiently\\n* Moderate gaming capabilities\\n\\nThe device continues Vivo's tradition of delivering value-oriented smartphones to the Indian market.",
